Let me introduce myself: I am Pepper, the reception robot here to help you make the most of this event.]]></text></pluginContent><Input name="onLoad" type="1" type_size="1" nature="0" inner="1" tooltip="Signal sent when Diagram is loaded." id="1" /><Input name="onStart" type="1" type_size="1" nature="1" inner="0" tooltip="To send the text on the output." id="2" /><Output name="onStopped" type="3" type_size="1" nature="2" inner="0" tooltip="The text you entered." id="3" /></Box><Box name="DisplayImage" id="10" localization="8" tooltip="Display an image on the tablet or the pico projector&#x0A;&#x0A;v0.6" x="493" y="601"><bitmap>media/images/box/box-python-script.png</bitmap><script language="4"><content><![CDATA[import abcdk.display

